Z||000000||Brandon86SE||09-30-2001||07:54 PM||||ok.... grr.... this is my fourth time trying to post this!  It keeps saying I'm exceeding the picture limit, even though I'm only putting up 7....  Anyway, here goes again!<P>Just to let everyone know, today was the day of the now semi-annual "Red Deer Run", where Fiero's from Alberta converge to meet.  Today we had 7 cars from Calgary, 11 from Edmonton, 1 from Bowden, and 1 from Grande Prarie.  That's 20 cars, a great showing!    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  Anyway, I got a bunch of great pics and here they are!<P>Meeting up at DQ in Red Deer first<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/DQ_1_(small).jpg"> <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/DQ_2_(small).jpg"> <P>Went to a grassy hill and took some more:<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/U_front_(small).jpg"> <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/U_side_(small).jpg"> <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/U_back_(small).jpg"> <P>Hope everyone had as much fun as I did.    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  See ya'll later.<P>Brandon<p>[This message has been edited by Brandon86SE (edited 09-30-2001).]||||reg||10
Z||000001||Brandon86SE||09-30-2001||07:59 PM||||More pics:<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Open_Front_(small)_1.jpg"> <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Open_back_(small).jpg"> <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/2_Row_Front_(small).jpg"> <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/2_Row_Back_(small).jpg"> <P>And a picture of the Calgary contingent when we met up before leaving<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Cgy_Parking_Lot_(small).jpg"> <P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Field_Front_(sig)_1.jpg"> ||||reg||1
